Any flag files placed in this directory will be sourced prior to executing chromium.

The blocked-flags file should contain a single line of space-separated switches
without their double hyphen prefix, of the form "switch1 switch2 ... switchN".
Switches containing a value  eg of the form 'something-foo=bar' are allowed.

The blocked-files file should contain a single line of pipe-separated filenames
of the form "file1|file2|...|fileN". By default the list contains READNE and
blocked-files itself.
